---
title: API Request Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Web as Web :3001
    participant API as API :3000
    participant Google

    Browser->>Web: Navigate to /dashboard
    Web->>API: GET /auth/me (credentials)
    API-->>Web: { user: {...} }
    Web-->>Browser: Render dashboard

    Browser->>Web: Click logout
    Web->>API: POST /auth/logout
    API-->>Web: { ok: true }
    Web-->>Browser: Redirect to /login
